  "question": {
    "text": "A beam of unpolarised light of intensity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math> is passed through a polaroid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and then through another polaroid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> which is oriented so that its principal plane makes an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo></math> relative to that of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>. The intensity of emergent light is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "HKA5f",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "6YKFt",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "jXT9x",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qR3gW",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Intensity of polarised light from polaroid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>. Therefore,</p><p>Intensity of emergent light<br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
